<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.2 Result Analysis ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Robust Latent Matters:Boosting Image Generation with Sampling Error Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Robust latent space.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px5" title="In 4.2 Result Analysis ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Robust Latent Matters:Boosting Image Generation with Sampling Error Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Perturbation selection &amp; annealing strategy.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px6" title="In 4.2 Result Analysis ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Robust Latent Matters:Boosting Image Generation with Sampling Error Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Qualitative results.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
