<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S1.F3.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S1.F3.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">T-SNE visualization of DINO Class features.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
